    "title": "Track & Field to Send Four to U.S. U20 Championships - NewsBreak",
    "text": "olemisssports.com\nwebsite\nOxford\nTrack & Field to Send Four to U.S. U20 Championships\n1 days ago\nEUGENE, Ore. – Ole Miss track & field will have four freshmen representatives at the 2025 U.S. U20 Championships, held at the University of Oregon's Hayward Field from June 19-20. Rebels in competition will be SEC silver medalist pole vaulter Lily Beattie and fellow freshman teammate Katie McFarland in the women's pole vault, freshman jumper Indya Dotson in the women's long jump, and recently crowned Second-Team All-American Jordan Urrutia in both the men's 100 and 200-meter dashes.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
